Scope note

The MIT license above covers the WorldReady internationalization kit and
scripts authored for this project (for example: the CI gate, the independent
verifier scripts, the demo mock, deployment plumbing, the viewer shell, and
supporting documentation).

The application code under `src/` derives from IBM/galaxium-travels
(https://github.com/IBM/galaxium-travels), commit
e4e18ae1b05e0c899abaefd920f5ffcb4326b021, which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. That upstream license is preserved verbatim in
`LICENSE-GALAXIUM` and continues to govern the derived application code.
